			title: "Working By Stone"
			x: 6.25d
			y: -4.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7The Stonemason's Hut is used to make recipes that involve Stone, Ores, Quartz, Purpur, and a few other materials. No Metals or Redstone items."
				""
				"&7For the Stonemason to make these items when another Worker or Building request them, it must have the materials on hand and know the recipe, which you can teach it in the interface."
			]
			dependencies: ["6F74DE164AB120DD"]
			id: "76754F745F3BDAB3"
