			title: "A Solid Mix"
			x: 6.25d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7The Concrete Mixer's Hut is used to make Concrete."
				""
				"&7It will make the Concrete Powder, place it in Water, then mine and store the resultant Concrete. It will only do this when another Worker or Building requests it, though."
				""
				"&7All the Concrete recipes are already taught to the Concrete Mixer."
			]
			dependencies: ["357D31D66E459063"]
