		{
			title: "Wood Works"
			x: 7.5d
			y: -4.75d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&7The Sawmill can craft items that are made mostly (75% or so) of Wood, and do not contain metal, stone, redstone, or string. It can also craft Cactus planks and similar items, Compost Barrels, Racks, and a few other items."
				""
				"&7The Sawmill will only craft these items if another Worker or Building has requested them, and you have taught it the appropriate recipe in the interface. And, of course, if it has the materials."
			]
			dependencies: ["056D01CFBD6E1603"]
